      "text": "Dating Filipinas vs Colombianas\n\n• You WILL find a more attractive partner in the Philippines, your value there is simply higher \n\n• The Latina 'fire' everyone romanticizes is just generational toxicity & trauma, it's fun for about 1 weekend\n\n• The most attractive Filipinas are just as attractive if not moreso than the best Colombianas, although the floor is probably lower\n\n• Medellín has 3x more tourists per local than Manila\n\n• Colombianas are jaded due to years of foreign men running the same playbook there, the discourse on gringos isn't good rn\n\nOne is a telenovela you're paying for, the other is a relationship",
